<BaseLayout title="About | How Ancient China Worked" description="What this project covers and how it approaches evidence about imperial China.">
  <section class="page-intro shell narrow"><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>A practical guide to imperial China</h1><p>How Ancient China Worked explains everyday institutions and social practices in plain English, while showing where the evidence is strong—and where it is not.</p><div class="prose"><h2>Our approach</h2><p>We begin with a specific question, use reliable scholarship and primary sources in translation, and separate consensus from interpretation. A short answer is useful; a careful answer is better.</p><p>This is a growing reference project, not a substitute for specialist research.</p></div></section>
